mmccall@emory.edu (Malinda McCall) wrote:
>Has the right to USE to Internet, yes.

Nope. You can debate all day about whether it SHOULD be a right (sign me
up in the 'pro' column), but the fact is it is NOT a right. 

>Has the right to ABUSE the Internet, no.

>My understanding (as feeble as it may be) is that the Internet is
