Essentially correct...er, I mean you're incorrect that you're incorrect.
However, note that the power exercised by the local site owner (who may or
may not be the site administrator) is absolute and dictatorial; they have
no obligation to provide anyone access if they choose not to. This point
might become a tad grayer in the case of users who pay directly for Net
access. As long as they take your money, they owe some kind of
service...but try telling the fascists at Prodigy that.

